le\":\"Docker Containers\",\"description\":\"Describe containers as runnable instances of images, emphasizing their isolated and lightweight nature.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Dockerfile\",\"description\":\"Introduce the Dockerfile as a script containing instructions for building a Docker image.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Docker Hub\",\"description\":\"Explain Docker Hub as a cloud-based registry service for sharing and managing Docker images.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Docker Volumes\",\"description\":\"Briefly explain how volumes are used for persistent data storage in containers.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Docker Networks\",\"description\":\"Briefly explain how containers communicate with each other and the outside world.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Setting Up Docker\",\"description\":\"Guide on how to install Docker on different operating systems.\",\"level\":1},{\"title\":\"Installation Guide\",\"description\":\"Step-by-step instructions for installing Docker Desktop on Windows, macOS, and Linux.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Verifying Installation\",\"description\":\"Commands to run to ensure Docker is correctly installed and running.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Your First Docker Application: A Practical Example\",\"description\":\"Hands-on tutorial to containerize a simple application.\",\"level\":1},{\"title\":\"Creating a Simple Web Application\",\"description\":\"Provide a basic code example (e.g., a 'Hello World' Flask app) to be containerized.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Writing Your First Dockerfile\",\"description\":\"Guide through creating a Dockerfile for the sample application, explaining each instruction.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Building Your Docker Image\",\"description\":\"Command to build the Docker image from the Dockerfile.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Running Your Docker Container\",\"description\":\"Command to run the newly built image as a container, mapping ports.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Accessing the Application\",\"description\":\"Instructions on how to access the running application in the browser.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Managing Docker Containers\",\"description\":\"Essential commands for interacting with running and stopped containers.\",\"level\":1},{\"title\":\"Listing Containers\",\"description\":\"Commands to view running and all containers.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Stopping and Starting Containers\",\"description\":\"Commands to gracefully stop and restart containers.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Removing Containers and Images\",\"description\":\"Commands to clean up stopped containers and unused images.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Inspecting Containers\",\"description\":\"Command to get detailed information about a running container.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Viewing Container Logs\",\"description\":\"Command to view the output logs of a container.\",\"level\":3},{\"title\":\"Introduction to Docker Compose\",\"description\":\"A brief overview of Docker Compose for managing multi-container applications.\",\"level\":1},{\"title\":\"What is Docker Compose?\",\"description\":\"Explain its purpose in defining and running multi-container Docker applications.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Basic `docker-compose.yml` Structure\",\"description\":\"Show a simple example of a `docker-compose.yml` file.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Running Multi-Container Applications\",\"description\":\"Briefly demonstrate how to use `docker-compose up`.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Best Practices for Dockerfiles\",\"description\":\"Tips and tricks for writing efficient and secure Dockerfiles.\",\"level\":1},{\"title\":\"Leveraging Layer Caching\",\"description\":\"Explain how Docker layers work and how to optimize Dockerfiles for faster builds.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Using Multi-stage Builds\",\"description\":\"Introduce multi-stage builds for creating smaller, more secure production images.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Minimizing Image Size\",\"description\":\"Strategies for reducing the final size of Docker images.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Security Considerations\",\"description\":\"Basic security practices when building Docker images (e.g., non-root user).\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Conclusion and Next Steps\",\"description\":\"Summarize the key takeaways and suggest further learning resources.\",\"level\":1},{\"title\":\"Recap of Key Benefits\",\"description\":\"Reiterate the advantages of using Docker for development and deployment.\",\"level\":2},{\"title\":\"Further Learning Resources\",\"description\":\"Suggest topics like Docker Swarm, Kubernetes, advanced networking, etc.\",\"level\":2}]}","responseLength":5496,"tokenUsage":{"inputTokens":2465,"outputTokens":1806,"totalTokens":7157},"estimatedCost":0.001453,"promptName":"planner","promptVersion":"v1","retryCount":3}
